<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Iran</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Iranian</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Iran is a country and historical region of south-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/asia">Asia</a>, centred on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iranian-plateau">Iranian plateau</a>. It was the heartland of a long line of empires, including the Median, Achaemenid, Parthian and Sasanian empires, and later the Safavid, Afsharid and Zand states. It was also ruled by external dynasties such as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seljuk-empire">Seljuks</a> and the Mongol <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ilkhanate">Ilkhanate</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/iran.jpg" alt="Iran" width="320" height="184" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: SVG file: SiBr4Designer: Hamid NadimiConstruction: ISIRI · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Iran_(official).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
